        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this substantial holding of planted forestry land located in the scenic rural area of Coolmeen, near Kilmactranny, Co. Sligo comprising approximately 15.49 hectares (38.26 acres) contained within Folio Nos: SL8826 (9.31 hectares) & SL17753 (6.18 hectares).\n\nThis well-positioned parcel of forestry land offers an excellent investment opportunity with approximately 96,000 remaining in forestry premiums payable, with only 4 of the 15 years having elapsed.\n\nSet within a peaceful countryside location, the lands are ideally suited for forestry investment purposes while also offering long-term potential in a highly regarded rural area. The property represents a rare opportunity to acquire an established forestry plantation with the benefit of ongoing premium income.\n\nThis property will appeal to forestry investors, landowners and those seeking a long-term rural investment opportunity.\n\nFurther details, maps and particulars available from Sole Selling Agent.\n\nViewing strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
