        "Content": "Forestry Lands at Coolmeen, near Kilmactranny, Co. Sligo\n\nFolio No. SL8826 Approx. 9.31 hectares (23.00 acres)\nFolio No. SL17753 Approx. 6.18 hectares (15.27 acres)\n\nTotal Holding: Approx. 15.49 hectares (38.26 acres)"
